WEBVTT

00:39:27.292 --> 00:39:30.530
that may be where
the key insights come from

00:39:30.554 --> 00:39:33.593
of, here is a promising cure,

00:39:33.617 --> 00:39:35.859
and that we will learn from those numbers,

00:39:35.883 --> 00:39:38.744
and indeed, that it will become
in the interest of the world

00:39:38.768 --> 00:39:40.523
to merge databases etc.

00:39:40.871 --> 00:39:42.736
But if it's the case

00:39:42.760 --> 00:39:47.220
that China is just much faster
and better at implementing,

00:39:47.244 --> 00:39:48.511
that's an argument ...

00:39:49.567 --> 00:39:52.120
I would have thought someone
in the US and in the West

00:39:52.144 --> 00:39:54.847
might view that as an argument
for why are we just having

00:39:54.871 --> 00:39:57.676
an open environment on sharing
all these advances.

00:39:57.700 --> 00:40:01.223
We aren't able to benefit from them
as much as others,